  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research for Development and Innovation Agriculture and Learning Action (ReDIAL Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the Action is to contribute to transformation and innovation in agriculture and food systems in Ghana through action research, application of innovative technologies and organization of farmers and multi-stakeholder platforms. The Specific objective is to foster innovation in improving soil fertility in Ghana by generating scientific knowledge and data while applying innovative technology to improve threshing of Grains and Cereals. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
